      "message": "Hello. Thanks for the patch! Unfortunately Qt decided to change the property name to `inverted` from `invert` when releasing Qt 6.11:\n- https://doc.qt.io/qt-6.10/qml-qtqml-models-filter.html\n- https://doc.qt.io/qt-6.11/qml-qtqml-models-filter.html\n\nThe original migration from the working 3rd party implementation that preceded Qt\u0027s SortFilterProxyModel had it right with `inverted`. Our 6.10 migration was followed up with a couple corrective changes:\n- https://review.jami.net/c/jami-client-qt/+/34118\n- https://review.jami.net/c/jami-client-qt/+/34119\n\nWe discussed your patch and we will move to Qt 6.11 shortly instead of applying a max Qt version, and this change can be part of the migration. We currently pin our deployments to the minimum version of 6.10.3. I will be happy to leave this confusion in the past.",
